security-domain: secure
machine: rp2350
---

# Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W, Arm

RP2350 Pico 2 W built for its Cortex-M33 Secure cores and linked by the Pico SDK
external build. platform.pico.mcu supplies GPIO, the default hardware UART, and
the monotonic timer. Wireless CYW43 facilities are outside this board contract;
its LED is not an RP2350 GPIO and is not reported as one.
